.DS_Store

# Working copies: full-resolution originals and any Instagram pull. These stay
# out of git — they are bulk, and nothing on the page references them.
assets/_original/
assets/_instagram/

# The shop's own photos, pulled from Booksy's CDN by fetch-assets.sh.
#
# CHANGED 2026-09-05: previously the whole of assets/ was ignored, on the
# grounds that these are not ours to redistribute. That is still true — but the
# site was published to a public URL on 2026-09-05, and an image-less gallery
# was showing a black gap to anyone who opened it. Malik's call: ship the 14
# images the page actually references, and nothing else.
#
# If Dope Fades ever object, this is the line to revert: re-ignore assets/ and
# the gallery goes quiet again on its own (every <img> has an onerror).
assets/*.jpeg
!assets/hero.jpeg
!assets/shop.jpeg
!assets/shop-03.jpeg
!assets/shop-04.jpeg
!assets/work-01.jpeg
!assets/work-02.jpeg
!assets/work-03.jpeg
!assets/work-04.jpeg
!assets/work-05.jpeg
!assets/work-06.jpeg
!assets/work-08.jpeg
!assets/work-10.jpeg
!assets/work-12.jpeg
!assets/work-13.jpeg
